  era: "c. 2500 BCE \xB7 Section 2 \xB7 Indus Valley Civilisation \xB7 c. 3300 \u2013 1300 BCE (mature phase c. 2600 \u2013 1900 BCE)"
  title: Harappan religion
  text: Evidence suggests reverence for a mother goddess, sacred animals and trees such as the pipal, and possibly a horned figure on the so-called Pashupati seal. Fire altars at Kalibangan and Lothal hint at ritual, but without readable texts much remains uncertain.
